  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institute for State Effectiveness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investments supports the Institute for State Effectiveness for the Afghanistan Support Program.  The program provides strategic advice to the Afghan Govenment and aims to strengthen operations, specifically: (i) financial practices through the delivery of financial policy training and refresher courses for staff including anti-corruption procedures; (ii) integrity systems by enabling and enhancing capability for criminal checks; and monitoring and evaluation support.</narrative>
  </description>
